<title>HONG KONG: Bank Rakyat Indonesia to launch $70 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank Rakyat Indonesia to launch $70 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificates of deposit issue has been pre-launched to the market, said arranger Sanwa International Finance.</p>
<p>The arranger group is expected to receive an official mandate from the borrower this week.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK RAKYAT INDONESIA ACTING THROUGH ITS CAYMAN</p>
<p>		ISLANDS BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$70 MLN  COUPON     6ML+65BP   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	 CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES   WK APR 21</p>
<p> LISTING    --	   REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATING   *BAA3/BBB PI HOME CTRY  INDONESIA  PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$7 MLN    40BP   ALL-IN  73</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS     US$5-6 MLN  35BP   ALL-IN  72</p>
<p>   CO-MANAGERS	   US$2-4 MLN  25BP   ALL-IN  70</p>
<p> ARRANGERS    BA ASIA, LTCB ASIA AND SANWA INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>		  FINANCE.</p>
<p> NOTES   *ISSUER RATING. THE BBB PI RATING FROM S&amp;P IS A</p>
<p>	   PUBLIC INFORMATION RATING.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
